  "routes_note": "A version can be served three ways, and the order of preference is: real Java (a JVM in the page runs the official jar, no copy of the game anywhere) > compiled by us from the official source (ahead-of-time, mods baked in) > a prebuilt Eaglercraft-family client, which exists because somebody already did that compile for that version. The prebuilt builds are not 'instead of' the official versions: they *are* those versions, ported to run in a browser, which is why they can be downloaded and played without a JVM."
}
